Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.11,0:00:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the Krosmic Era,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.39,0:00:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}year 490...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.39,0:00:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The great Queen of Bonta and Amakna,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.19,0:00:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zabel Sheran Sharm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dreamed of unifying,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.39,0:00:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}all the nations of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}under her banner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As guardian of the Ebony Dofus,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it seemed there was no longer anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}in this world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}who could stand in Zabel's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.82,0:00:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Continuing to camp in the snowfields
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.54,0:00:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,is not a wise strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike our soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.14,0:00:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the Forg soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,are not used to the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.14,0:00:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time to endure,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.78,0:00:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shedar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.71,0:01:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A breakthrough will present itself eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.35,0:01:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how about using the dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.83,0:01:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.03,0:01:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.47,0:01:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,it is time for your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.91,0:01:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.83,0:01:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Auguste.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.15,0:01:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just smelling the aroma
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.44,0:01:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,makes me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.43,0:01:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, please have some too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.63,0:01:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I will pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.79,0:01:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.47,0:01:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.51,0:01:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you eat so calmly at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.27,0:01:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,For you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,this is your first battle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You will get used to it eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.40,0:01:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.46,0:01:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your food
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The fight should begin very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.26,0:01:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.46,0:01:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I said, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.95,0:02:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Jabel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Balakzar,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord of Forg!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.03,0:02:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.60,0:02:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that you came here seeking
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.46,0:02:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,this Balak!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.05,0:02:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not wish to waste
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the lives of brave soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.69,0:02:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to appeal to your courage,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Zabel Sheran Sharm!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.49,0:02:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I challenge you to a duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.29,0:02:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept your offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.61,0:02:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Balakzar!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.56,0:03:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust Her Majesty, Shedar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She was fighting long before
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,you ever learned to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.61,0:03:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You are as bold as the rumors say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.53,0:03:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And seeing you up close,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.77,0:03:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you are even more beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.37,0:03:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you are quite good at flattery despite your looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.34,0:03:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,far too many rumors about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.86,0:03:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Zabel the Fratricide,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.86,0:03:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,master of the black dragon Azalar...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.34,0:03:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,For years,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been captivated by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.79,0:03:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Zabel,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.15,0:03:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I will become King
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.43,0:03:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and obey your every command,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and you shall bear me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,beautiful wolf cubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.02,0:03:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A tempting offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a rumor that all of your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,previous partners
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:03:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,ended up being eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I formally decline
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.46,0:04:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,your marriage proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.51,0:04:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.83,0:04:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There is only one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.27,0:04:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I am interested in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.95,0:04:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My Crimson Dofus...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.31,0:04:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It was one of the few pieces missing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,from your collection, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.79,0:04:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the one who asked for a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How long do you intend to make me wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.92,0:04:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Zabel, if i win,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.48,0:04:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill every single one of your soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I am fully
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I will display your head and your son's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,right above my bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful Zabel...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cheeks are blushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.26,0:05:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.05,0:05:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, Mother is in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.09,0:05:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,has known how to fight since the day she was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.41,0:05:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,,t's been a long time since I've seen
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.48,0:05:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Her Majesty having so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.39,0:05:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your first time fighting here, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.07,0:05:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.95,0:06:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There were many fools who tried
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,to steal my Dofus,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.03,0:06:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but as you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.39,0:06:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I turned them all to bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You are fighting me here, in the graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,of heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,foolish are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.59,0:06:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.41,0:06:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.01,0:06:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,will pay for this in the afterlife!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.09,0:06:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Zabel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.89,0:07:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a safe journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.25,0:07:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Balakzar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.98,0:07:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid work, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.22,0:07:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he manage to hit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing more than a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shedar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.98,0:07:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.75,0:08:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Shedar,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no time, so I'll keep it short.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.83,0:08:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,In Breshka Village,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.66,0:08:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,there is the rightful heir to Bonta.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.15,0:08:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The son of Canel Sheran Sharm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.51,0:08:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He has vivid blue eyes, just like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, the two of you must
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,put an end to Zabel's reign!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.56,0:08:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.09,0:08:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dofus are dragon eggs,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.49,0:08:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}granting infinite power\Nto their guardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.65,0:08:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There are six Dofus in total,\Nknown as the Primordial Dofus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.56,0:08:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For centuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}they have been the cause of brutal wars \Nacross the World of Twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.62,0:09:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To make a pie,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you need a lot of mushrooms. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.22,0:09:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,About one kilogram, I suppose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but the volume shrinks when you cook them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.26,0:09:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Should be enough like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.44,0:09:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, I picked the mushrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Welsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up and cook them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.48,0:09:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A little bit of olive oil...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I like to add a bit of butter to the oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.73,0:10:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.49,0:10:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The mushrooms are done!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.89,0:10:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, next... you know what to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking of adding some herbs and garlic. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.00,0:10:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.25,0:10:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No more than two cloves of garlic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.53,0:10:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Any more than that and the garlic flavor
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.21,0:10:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,will be too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I love about you, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You never say no to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't crush a young chef's creativity!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.64,0:10:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, the ones who judge\Nif it's good or bad are the customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.03,0:10:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Add 300ml
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.55,0:10:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,of fresh cream, 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.95,0:10:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,garlic,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.07,0:10:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,chives,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.66,0:10:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and 200g of cheese...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it would have been better
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,to sauté the garlic first?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I sliced it thinly, so it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.35,0:10:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, a pinch of salt and pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.02,0:11:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Garlic and herbs...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a great idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's push it slightly inward\Nto make a thick pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, the center of the pie
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,will be much juicier!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.06,0:11:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,what a gluttonous child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.86,0:11:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I am your son, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, hurry up and load them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.68,0:11:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, this guy is definitely doing it on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say silly things to a cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.72,0:12:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up! Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.00,0:12:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(384,938)\b1}Mushroom Pie
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shedar...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It still feels like drums are \Npounding inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.19,0:13:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.27,0:13:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You were hit by the magic of the Dofus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.71,0:13:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.59,0:13:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw a vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.99,0:13:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A dragon spoke to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.55,0:13:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.03,0:13:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Dardondakal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.79,0:13:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me strange things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He said I must stop you, Mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.71,0:13:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and put an end to your reign!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.43,0:13:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,To search for the rightful heir to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.87,0:13:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,In Breshka Village...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.39,0:13:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,the former King,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.51,0:13:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Canel's son!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.31,0:13:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Canel's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.87,0:13:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,son...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.51,0:13:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he has blue eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.83,0:13:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,just like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.63,0:13:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is all this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shedar,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,that was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.99,0:13:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're exhausted from your first battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you too, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That vision you saw...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shedar...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.04,0:15:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Azaral!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother has returned, hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Dardondakal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The only dragon capable\Nof humiliating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He spoke to Shedar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better be careful of the visions\Nshown by that schemer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How long will I have to be tormented by him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.07,0:15:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Was I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.55,0:15:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed his guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.03,0:15:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,When a dragon seeks revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.11,0:15:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter where they are
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,or how long it takes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.07,0:15:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,they will fulfill their goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as I am by your side, there is no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.84,0:15:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to go to Breshka\Nand find a certain child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.52,0:16:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A child?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Canel's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.03,0:16:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.75,0:16:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I cannot refuse your requests.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.98,0:16:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,well, moving my body a little bit\Nisn't so bad either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.86,0:16:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Azaral...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.74,0:16:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,For a long time now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.14,0:16:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For a while longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you can still use me and my Dofus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.09,0:17:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Azaral...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry we are late!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.55,0:17:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are late again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.95,0:17:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, come on, what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.54,0:17:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,you caught a splendid red mullet this morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stop by later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.30,0:17:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, using flirting tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please show up on time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.70,0:17:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's always such a hassle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it was because of Moo again...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just throw that cat\Ninside a pie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.70,0:17:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That solves the problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your change!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna toss a coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.97,0:17:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Heads you lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.33,0:17:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,tails and you win another\Njar of honey for free!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.89,0:17:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I always lose, but shall I try?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.49,0:17:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel somewhat lucky today!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.38,0:18:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tails this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.14,0:18:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later, Bechamel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.94,0:18:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mom! Welsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.95,0:18:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Late again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.35,0:18:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Becha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It took some time to bake the pies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.83,0:18:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And Moo was interfering again...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.91,0:18:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How are things going, Bechamel?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.91,0:18:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.11,0:18:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of them have already been sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.03,0:18:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find treasure in the mountains again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.19,0:18:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Becha make these too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.20,0:18:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pain d'épices!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, try a taste!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.58,0:18:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.94,0:18:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.18,0:18:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And these?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.30,0:18:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cookies made with apples, walnuts, and honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Give one to Welsh too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.70,0:18:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It might give him some energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, I hope so!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.52,0:18:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, help me over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Becha,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.52,0:19:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,could you save some honey?\Nand pain d'épices for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange for a meat pie and a mushroom pie!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.30,0:19:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, smells amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.50,0:19:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.30,0:19:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.50,0:19:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.41,0:19:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.29,0:19:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.41,0:19:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A cheese pie, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.05,0:19:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And a red berry tart too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.25,0:19:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawberry season will be ending soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.13,0:19:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,so I want to enjoy them while I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.64,0:19:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,it must be hard doing this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Have those already sold out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.36,0:19:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.08,0:19:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.48,0:20:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What a lovely couple you two make! 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.70,0:20:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute, turning all red like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.40,0:20:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's not...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.68,0:20:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.60,0:20:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,please don't tease my boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Boyfriend?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.20,0:20:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when did we become a couple?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.41,0:20:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell lies like that in front of customers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.81,0:20:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? It's fine if everyone knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.21,0:20:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Our love has been kept a secret for so long already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.17,0:20:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.49,0:20:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, just tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.17,0:20:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd love to hear a love story!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.57,0:20:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.69,0:20:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.33,0:20:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.85,0:20:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The degree of ripeness is exquisite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.97,0:20:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.49,0:20:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I am honored, Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.33,0:20:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I will throw in this Spring Heart as a bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it will be to your liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You certainly know how to treat a woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:20:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Chabichou.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.60,0:21:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my muse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my goddess!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I must head back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.14,0:21:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're already sold out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.62,0:21:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're already sold out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.78,0:21:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You were quite late,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.52,0:21:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,so I assume you found what you were looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.43,0:21:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! Tonight we're having seafood pot-au-feu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.79,0:21:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to join us, Becha?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.95,0:21:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Seafood?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.99,0:21:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.03,0:21:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But stop talking about love stories, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.79,0:21:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't find it funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.67,0:21:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that depends on the situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.36,0:21:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:21:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon...?
